        <mxCell id="LEG_STEPS" value="&lt;b&gt;[&#9312;]&lt;/b&gt; Cidad&#227;o acessa o SPA por HTTPS.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[&#9313;]&lt;/b&gt; Front-end Angular (SPA + Wizard 7 telas + ComplaintService + ApiClient) captura, valida e monta a submiss&#227;o.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[&#9314;]&lt;/b&gt; Wizard consulta UF/munic&#237;pios no IBGE, com fallback local em municipios-ibge.json.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[&#9315;]&lt;/b&gt; Entrada segura no BFF: Helmet/CORS + Rate limit (contadores no Redis) + POST /api/denuncias.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[&#9316;]&lt;/b&gt; Multer diskStorage grava anexos no diret&#243;rio tempor&#225;rio (20 MB &#183; 10 arq.).&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[&#9317;]&lt;/b&gt; Camada de aplica&#231;&#227;o: ComplaintController orquestra e ComplaintService valida, gera protocolo e monta payload.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[&#9318;]&lt;/b&gt; Verifica&#231;&#227;o antimalware: Cliente ClamAV envia anexos por INSTREAM ao ClamAV daemon.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[&#9319;]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#1E8449&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;INTEGRA&#199;&#195;O SUD &#8594; MPT Digital&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: MPT API Client encaminha (Bearer/timeout) &#224; API interna do MPT.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[&#9320;]&lt;/b&gt; Resposta 201 + protocolo (ou erro expl&#237;cito) devolvida ao SPA.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[&#9321;]&lt;/b&gt; Limpeza de tempor&#225;rios no bloco finally (sempre executada).&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[aux]&lt;/b&gt; Health e Swagger &#8212; rotas auxiliares de observabilidade.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;[cfg]&lt;/b&gt; Vari&#225;veis e segredos &#8212; configura&#231;&#227;o de runtime (Rate limit, MPT client)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#FBFCFD;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#17324D;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2485" y="580" width="360" height="335" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LEG_SEC3" value="Refer&#234;ncias (fontes desta vista)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#17324D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
